{"guid":"grp-1-0","timestamp_unix_ms":1785839438274,"direction":"outgoing","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"A gentleman and a stranger!  \"I deserve neither such praise nor such censure,\" cried Elizabeth; \"I am _not_ a great reader, and I have pleasure in many things.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-1-1","timestamp_unix_ms":1785839602274,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+12024318320","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"She told the story, however, with great spirit among her friends; for she had a lively, playful disposition, which delighted in anything ridiculous.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-1-2","timestamp_unix_ms":1785847983274,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+12129397565","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"It would have spared her, she thought, one sleepless night out of two.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-1-3","timestamp_unix_ms":1785865145274,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+12149668944","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"You promised me to _insist_ upon her marrying him.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-1-4","timestamp_unix_ms":1785872147274,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+15122692143","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":" and she coloured at the idea; but, recovering herself, said in a lively tone, \"And pray, what is the usual price of an earl's younger son?","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-1-5","timestamp_unix_ms":1785873531274,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+12129765380","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"I thought I should have broke my heart.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
